# Gig Work Exclusion

- Do not modify, refactor, review, test, or otherwise work on gig-related screens, widgets, ribbons, or services unless the user explicitly asks for gig work.
- Treat paths containing `gig` and services such as `lib/domain/services/*gig*.dart` as out of scope by default.
- If a broader task appears to require touching gig code, ask for confirmation before proceeding.
